  "description": "*\nElectric DK2 Premium Accessory Package adds 7 popular MADSEN Accessories with $402 in bundle savings: front rack / soft top / front lights / rear lights / dutch upgrade / shiny brass bell / water bottle.\nCheck out our Luxury Accessory package and other MADSEN Accessories.\nElectric DK2 Specs:\n\nFRAME: Building on MADSEN's renowned excellent handling and comfort, the DK2 features a taller stem and head tube for a more upright riding position. A new front fork features a beautiful biplane crown and thru-axle dropouts, adding strength, while internal cable routing gives the frame a clean, sleek look.\n\nBRAKES: Jagwire/RIDEREVER CARGO-TE. This hydraulic brake system features a CNC-machined caliper with extra-thick 5mm brake pads and extra-thick rotors 2.3mm. 203mm front rotor, 180mm rear rotor. creating worry-free, long-lasting, superior braking power, specifically designed from the ground up for heavy cargo bikes.\n\nTIRES: The new frame makes room for comfortable, plush XL tires.\n\nELECTRIC SYSTEM: Integrated 750-watt Bafang mid-drive motor (500-watt for Canada), powerful 48V 13Ah battery with lockable mount, 120 Nm of torque, pedal assist system with 5 power levels, gear sensor for smooth shifting, and LCD display.",
